 "costs": "taker 5bp, slippage 1.5bp, half spread 0.5bp; funding at 8h settlements as the backtester; funding-avoidance exit mirrored",
 "decision": "every 4h close (03:59, 07:59, ... UTC); move = 24h return / (daily ATR14 / close); OI = ctx.extras oi_chg_24h (contracts); market entry at the next open, stop sl_atr x daily ATR14, no target, time stop hold_h (engine 0.5R extension with a 1.5 x 4h-ATR trail mirrored)",
